; Wheel visual roots, IN THE SAME ORDER as tanker_spec.tres's wheel_positions (L/R per axle, front
; bogie axle first) — TowedBody pairs them by index and errors on a count mismatch. The radius
; scale and the right-side flip ride the INSTANCED CHILD, because RayWheel overwrites each root's
; transform every tick; the flip is about Vector3.RIGHT, never UP (local Y is the axle).
